{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Sañjaya","html":"<article id='thag1.48'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.48 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.48 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Pañcamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Five </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Sañjayattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sañjaya </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yato ahaṁ pabbajito, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Since I went forth </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Agārasmānagāriyaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>from the lay life to homelessness, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nābhijānāmi saṅkappaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve not been aware of any thought </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Anariyaṁ dosasaṁhitan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that is ignoble and hateful. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Sañjayo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
